ived_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-02-22T23:57:40Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T17:05:23Z","closed_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103197","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103197","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103197.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103197.patch","merged_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:05Z"},"body":"Simpler alternative to #103026 which avoids breaking compatibility.\r\n    \r\nInstead of introducing a new `auto` default value, we ensure that all\r\nsupported drivers are registered regardless of the editor's host platform,\r\nand that the defaults are the intended ones.\r\n\r\nThis solves the following issues:\r\n- macOS exports are meant to default to Metal in 4.4, but they would\r\n  default to Vulkan if exported from Linux, Windows, or Android editors.\r\n- Windows exports couldn't be made with Direct3D 12 from Linux, macOS, or\r\n  Android editors, as the option couldn't be selected outside Windows.\r\n\r\nUnlike #103026, it doesn't solve the issue of not always saving the\r\nrendering drivers to `project.godot`, but now the defaults are at least\r\nconsistent between editor platforms. So that issue is a lot less problematic,\r\nor maybe not even an issue anymore, but may be considered working as\r\nintended (so we can keep changing defaults if we want and have projects\r\nauto-upgrade).\r\n\r\n- Reverts #103026.\r\n- Fixes #103156.\r\n- Partially supersedes #103144. Some of the changes there are still worth doing, I can add them to this PR too, or #103144 could be rebased after this is merged.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nBefore (Linux editor):\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c09a9eb1-326f-4aad-8882-deec18038ab6)\r\n\r\nAfter (Linux editor):\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce5a1fda-551e-4ba8-8653-15f156f735b4)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103197/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103197/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}